# TradeBase

Trade signals & alerts platform for retail traders in Uganda, Kenya and Zambia.

Static site. No build step, no npm install, no framework. Open `index.html`
and it runs.

---

## What it is

A signals feed with a public track record, an alert signup form, and local
pricing tiers. It does **not** execute trades, manage money, or hold client
funds — it publishes trade ideas with entry, stop and targets, and keeps
every published call on the board whether it wins or loses.

The design leans into three things that matter for this audience:

1. **Mobile-first.** Most traffic will be on Android over mobile data.
   Layout is single-column down to ~360px and there are no heavy assets.
2. **Verifiable track record.** The stats strip is computed live from closed
   signals — including losers. A board of 100% wins reads as a scam.
3. **Local signals.** Analyst names and cities (Kampala, Nairobi, Lusaka)
   are visible on every card. Pricing is shown in UGX / KES / ZMW alongside
   USD.

